+
+Goal: Integrate the final Abyss robotics Kalman lab per .design-input/GOAL.md.
+Completed cycles: 0 of 3. Cycle 1 building; latest score: not assessed.
+Acceptance: cinematic foundation; physical silent controls; paused scrub/end; exact noise match; truthful help; novice lesson and dropout feedback; complete plot bounds; guarded numerical inputs; no-JS fallback; full regression and fresh three-size browser checks.
+Changes: kalman/{index.html,styles.css,app.js,model.js,controls.js}.
+Remaining: tests, browser journeys, evidence, DELIVERY.md, checker review.
+''', encoding='utf-8')

